<title>GERMANY: Germany to set tender for BOBLs on Nov 26-Buba.</title>
<headline>Germany to set tender for BOBLs on Nov 26-Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany will set terms for an auction of series 120 BOBLs on November 26 and simultaneously stop selling the series as a tap issue, the Bundesbank as issuing agent said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids for the issue will be accepted up to 1000 GMT on November 27, the Bundesbank said. The pay date is November 29.</p>
<p>Terms for a new tap issue will also be announced on that day, the central bank said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
